sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Frontend)
    participant B as Backend API (Cloud Run)
    participant AI as Google Vision API
    participant SC as Ethereum Smart Contract
    
    Note over U, SC: 1. Identity Onboarding
    U->>B: Uploads ID Document & Details
    B->>AI: Sends document for OCR Extraction
    AI-->>B: Returns extracted text/validation
    B->>SC: Writes Identity Hash to Blockchain
    SC-->>U: Identity Verified & Anchored
    
    Note over U, SC: 2. Selective Disclosure & Consent
    U->>SC: Grants targeted access to 3rd Party
    SC-->>B: Access event recorded on-chain
    
    Note over U, SC: 3. Revocation & Self-Destruct
    alt Manual Revocation
        U->>SC: Revokes access (1-click)
    else Auto-Expiry (Cron)
        B->>SC: Triggers self-destruct function
    end
    SC-->>U: Access permanently terminated
